      "value": "Did a bit of testing and the severity of the issue seems to be based on the number of colliders over the limit that is being imposed.  In a packed map, say around 40 people, you can get a 50GB log file in an hour or two.\nIn a map with less than 10 people it still occurred and I had a log file around 100MB after around 5~10 minutes.",
